234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 604 0 R
/E (we set up the virtual environment needed for penetration testing. We installed VirtualBox and imported Kali Linux as our attacker machine and Metasploitable as our target/victim machine. Both virtual machines were configured to use a Host-Only Adapter network so they can communicate with each other privately. After booting both VMs, we used the ifconfig command on Metasploitable to identify its IP address, which will be used in the scanning and exploitation phases.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
