/P 188 0 R
/T ( demonstrates three key post-exploitation commands executed on the Metasploitable target machine. First, ifconfig confirmed the target's IP address as 192.168.56.102. Second, whoami returned 'root', proving we have the highest level of system privileges. Third, cat /etc/passwd began listing user accounts, starting with the root account entry root:x:0:0:root:/root:/bin/bash, confirming full administrative access to the system)
/E ( demonstrates three key post-exploitation commands executed on the Metasploitable target machine. First, ifconfig confirmed the target's IP address as 192.168.56.102. Second, whoami returned 'root', proving we have the highest level of system privileges. Third, cat /etc/passwd began listing user accounts, starting with the root account entry root:x:0:0:root:/root:/bin/bash, confirming full administrative access to the system)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
